{"t":"Blessing Charms","s":"blessing-charms-950fe","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Blood_of_the_Mountain_Item_1c184c.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Blessing Charms</strong> are single-use items that provide <a href=\"#/wiki/Blessings\">blessings</a>. Each item will give the user its respective blessing.\n</p><p>Blood of the Mountain, Heart of the Mountain, <a href=\"#/wiki/Solitude%20Charm\">Solitude Charm</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Spiritual%20Charm\">Spiritual Charm</a> are available as quest rewards. With the exception of Heart of the Mountain and Blood of the Mountain, all other blessing charms may be dropped by <a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a>.\n</p><p>Charms were given to players as a compensation for blessings lost in PvE deaths during <i>exceptional connection issues</i> such as heavy DDoS attacks that took place from August 21, 2013, till April 25, 2017. Additionally, all PvE deaths between August 01 and September 06, 2013, were compensated.\n</p><p>Both the Blood of the Mountain and the Heart of the Mountain can also be obtained from a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mystery%20Box\">Mystery Box</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">Attributes\n</th>\n<th style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">Weight\n</th>\n<th>Dropped By\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Blood of the Mountain (Item)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blood of the Mountain (Item)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_of_the_Mountain_Item_1c184c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">10.00\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ravenous%20Hunger\">Ravenous Hunger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20False%20God\">The False God</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Essence%20of%20Malice\">Essence of Malice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Source%20of%20Corruption\">The Source of Corruption</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Heart of the Mountain (Item)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Heart of the Mountain (Item)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Heart_of_the_Mountain_Item_e1023b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">10.00\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Sandking\">The Sandking</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Souldespoiler\">The Souldespoiler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Unarmored%20Voidborn\">The Unarmored Voidborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Spawn%20of%20Morgathla\">Ancient Spawn of Morgathla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Source%20of%20Corruption\">The Source of Corruption</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Phoenix Charm\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Phoenix Charm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Phoenix_Charm_0691a4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">10.00\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Solitude%20Charm\">Solitude Charm</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Solitude%20Charm\"><img alt=\"Solitude Charm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Solitude_Charm_09a2d2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">10.00\n</td>